{"title": "SG Dominated", "pageid": 34975, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/SG_Dominated", "categories": ["Status groups"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><b>SG_Dominated</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_group\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status group\">status group</a>. Conditions in this status group generally grant control of the affected entity to whoever applied the condition.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_in_SG_Dominated\">List of conditions in SG_Dominated</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Controlled\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Controlled_(Condition)\" title=\"Controlled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Controlled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Controlled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Controlled_(Condition)\" title=\"Controlled (Condition)\">Controlled</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> is under the control of a <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a>. It will follow the Paladin and attack their enemies.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Dominated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_(Condition)\" title=\"Dominated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dominated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Dominated_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_(Condition)\" title=\"Dominated (Condition)\">Dominated</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity will follow and fight alongside the caster of this spell.</li>\n<li>Every time it takes damage, it may break the caster's control over it with a successful Wisdom <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Dominated\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_(Dominate_Beast)_(Condition)\" title=\"Dominated (Dominate Beast) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dominated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Dominated_Dominate_Beast_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_(Dominate_Beast)_(Condition)\" title=\"Dominated (Dominate Beast) (Condition)\">Dominated</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity will follow and fight alongside the caster of this spell.</li>\n<li>Every time it takes damage, it may break the caster's control over it with a successful Wisdom <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Incubus_Charmed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incubus_Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Incubus Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incubus Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Incubus_Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Incubus Charmed (Condition)\">Incubus Charmed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You are charmed by a devil and must support it in battle. You can make another <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against this effect after taking damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Seized_by_Planar_Binding\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_(Condition)\" title=\"Seized by Planar Binding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Seized by Planar Binding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Seized_by_Planar_Binding_(Condition)\" title=\"Seized by Planar Binding (Condition)\">Seized by Planar Binding</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity follows and fights for the one who has bound it.</li>\n<li>Every time it takes damage, it may break the caster's control over it with a successful <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Wayward_Undead\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wayward_Undead_(Condition)\" title=\"Wayward Undead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wayward Undead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Enthralled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wayward_Undead_(Condition)\" title=\"Wayward Undead (Condition)\">Wayward Undead</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is controlled by Mystic Carrion until combat ends. When this affect ends, the entity is destroyed.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205640\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1585/1000000\nPost‐expand 